# Stripe Webhook Test Endpoints
# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5152
@workspaceId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Stripe Webhook - test mode (DI / routing check)
# Ocekujem 400 Bad Request, Missing signature
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/stripe/test?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Stripe webhook – LIVE mode (routing only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/stripe/live?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Stripe webhook – fake signature (should still fail cleanly)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/stripe/test?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=123,v1=invalid

{
  "id": "evt_test_123",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded"
}


### Test Mode - Payment Intent Succeeded
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/stripe/test?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=test_signature_replace_with_real_in_production

{
  "id": "evt_test_12345",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "created": 1234567890,
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_test_12345",
      "amount": 4999,
      "currency": "eur",
      "latest_charge": "ch_test_12345",
      "receipt_email": "customer@example.com",
      "created": 1234567890
    }
  }
}

### Live Mode - Payment Intent Succeeded (when ready for production)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/stripe/live?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=live_signature_replace_with_real

{
  "id": "evt_live_12345",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "created": 1234567890,
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_live_12345",
      "amount": 9999,
      "currency": "eur",
      "latest_charge": "ch_live_12345",
      "receipt_email": "live-customer@example.com",
      "created": 1234567890
    }
  }
}